+# Revision8 bounded policy corrections
+
+Contract pi-accounting-contract/1.7-s1. Source policy PLAN43d0e7c8, adopted ROOT-ADOPTION-R6. All175 cases keep exact inputs, historical blocks, older revision logs and unreadable evidence. Whole-field reversible revisions_r8 retain attributable predecessor expectations. No new case or raw fixture is substituted for an existing one.
+
+Nine positive local lows survive rejected/conflicting settlement. Three named two-observation aggregate lows become15M without admitted physical independence. Seven RS auxiliary attachments become separate AtLeast0 anchors, preserving usage contexts/highs and attribution. U08/Q5 use TierUnestablished(Missing)/(Unrecognised); nonobject U07 uses canonical UsageShape. See oracle/R8-RAW-DERIVATIONS.md and R8-CORPUS-CLASSIFICATION.json for exact cases and policy reasons.
+
+The24 named low assertions replace the superseded Python sum-of-local-lows assertion. Other scopes remain REQUIRED/UNMET and are printed by the actual check command. Full per-unit AccountingResult wire/reference qualification and arbitrary raw-to-output conformance remain REQUIRED/UNMET. Structural/legacy175case success is not financial qualification or S1 acceptance.
