+# Revision8 independent bounded raw assertions
+
+Owner: oracle worker01a1d81b. Policy: accepted PLAN43d0e7c8 and ROOT-ADOPTION-R6. These assertions are authored separately from canonical financial logic. Canonical code supplies schema/shape/static dependency checks only. No raw financial reducer, solver or interpreter is implemented. Conditional scenario records remain conditional; they establish no live producer/writer/independence/linkage grant.
+
+The exact source inputs remain in every corpus case and frozen-raw/. R8-CORPUS-CLASSIFICATION.json binds all175 input digests, unreadable origins and historical preservation. R8-LOW-ASSERTIONS.json binds24 finite scope assertions to exact inputs. Other350 scope low claims remain REQUIRED/UNMET; the actual check command prints that limit even when its structural/legacy checks pass. Existing raw-selection P6 and independent raw arithmetic remain separate from full correlation/ownership qualification.
+
+The copied Python check no longer asserts that aggregate low equals sum(local hold lows). Its replacement consumes the named raw-bound literal low assertions. No unsupported default aggregate low is manufactured for missing scopes. High summation remains. raw_reservation now counts exact raw lines, so whitespace/key-order-equivalent JSON is distinct; scoped exact-byte copies remain idempotent. This inherited conditional-scope entry point alone does not qualify unknown-scope copy admission.
+
+## Local low derivations
+
+Pinned OpenAI rates: Astra input10USD/million and output50USD/million; Terra output5USD/million. Pinned Anthropic Sonnet input2USD/million, Fable input8USD/million. Thus1000 Astra input+100 output=(1000*10+100*50)/1e6=.015USD=15M nano.10000 Sonnet input=.02USD=20M; Fable alternative=.08USD=80M.12000 Terra output=.06USD=60M; Astra alternative=.6USD. Settlement rejection/cardinality conflicts do not erase these observations. Positive local low basis is usage_valuation. Their held highs remain conservative and unresolved.
+
+<a id="A06-reservation-usage-null-status-no-id"></a>
+A06: raw null status blocks settlement acceptance;1000/100 counts still support15M. Reservation250M remains held.
+
+<a id="P133-A06-usage-settlement-status-absent"></a>
+P133-A06: missing status blocks acceptance; same1000/100 gives15M.
+
+<a id="P133-A09-conflicting-reservations-with-settlement"></a>
+P133-A09: two distinct reservations preclude unique witness; same1000/100 gives15M.
+
+<a id="P130-R05-conflicting-keeps-valuation-high"></a>
+P130-R05: two observation rows with10000 input each and priced Sonnet/Fable contexts are alternatives, not independent bills. Local low20M/high80M survive conflict. The detached refusal adds its own unresolved zero anchor; it remains pricing context for usage.
+
+<a id="V01-cheaper-response-model-undercharge"></a>
+V01-undercharge:12000 output at Terra5/Astra50 supports60M–600M. Charge60M underprices complete context; held reservation800M remains. Low60M survives.
+
+<a id="P9-claimed-charge-above-reservation"></a>
+P9: charged/reserved inconsistency does not remove1000/100 usage15M.
+
+<a id="S06-string-http-status"></a>
+S06: raw status string prevents accepted settlement;1000/100 usage15M remains.
+
+<a id="U05-inconsistent-charge-without-response-id"></a>
+U05: inconsistent charge and absent response_id do not erase priced1000/100 usage15M.
+
+<a id="V02-unsplit-writes-undercharged"></a>
+V02: existing independently audited residual-write derivations support10M; undercharge rejection cannot force it to0. This control inherits the attributed raw-axis rate derivation, rather than claiming a fresh full multiobservation reducer.
+
+<a id="DUP-response-id-across-attempts"></a>
+DUP: two1000/100 observations have local15M each. No raw physical-bill independence frame exists; matching response ID is no grant. Fixed aggregate supported floor15M, not30M. Distinct conservative high holds sum30M.
+
+<a id="VC11-multi-turn-session"></a>
+VC11: two1000/100 observations across turns do not prove independently billable occurrences. Both local15M; aggregate supported floor15M without an admitted frame.
+
+<a id="P132-FG-VC11-gated"></a>
+The future-profile VC11 variant changes gate assumptions, not bill independence. Conditional test_mock gate input establishes no physical slot grant. Its supported floor also15M.
+
+## Seven explicit anchor amendments
+
+N01-identity-refusal-dearer-served, N01-orphan-identity-refusal, N01-variant-reservation-above-both, N04-budgeted-header-failure-own-reservation, N04-duplicated-read-failure, P130-R05-conflicting-keeps-valuation-high and VC07-read-failure-paired previously attached an auxiliary by RS1/2/3. No affirmative exact-row co-reference grant exists in their unchanged raw input. Each auxiliary origin now has a separate AtLeast0 PiApi unit with the same possible/owned attribution inventory. Removing display attachment does not remove priced financial context. Original/refined positive highs and supported usage lows survive; unresolved tag/provisionality remains even for zero numeric anchor.
+
+VC07 specifically has request Exact15M plus anchor AtLeast0, hence aggregate AtLeast15M. Its unchanged unadmitted ownership does not create owned spend; its possible-owner report is provisional and blocked. The historical predecessor expectation remains attributable in revisions_r8.from and immutable predecessor. VC07-conditional.bundle.json is a separate conditional exact-payload harness: exact origins a/u, closed synthetic request extent, no omitted competitor or duplicate origin are explicit assumptions. It is not a raw fixture verified:true flag and no live guarantee is claimed. Its genuine-unbudgeted applicability and completed priced valuation are separate computed witnesses, never ExpectedAssertion release authority.
+
+## Finite controls and limits
+
+r8-controls/ has independently typed literal expectation records separate from raw scenario/provenance and supplied computed projections. Actual `validate_corpus.py assertions RAW RESULT EXPECTED` checks exact raw-byte binding and exact JSON fields. Self-consistent wrong units plus matching rollups, exchanged origin ownership with unchanged money, and raw-source changes are rejected. No expected financial value comes from the canonical Rust builder.
+
+H2/F1/C1/F3 snapshots carry full unit/origin/high/basis/candidate/coverage/credit maps for A-first, B-first and all-at-once declared routes. They are supplied finite snapshots, not execution of discovery transitions. Dynamic confluence over arbitrary raw evidence is REQUIRED/UNMET. A flag or passing snapshot equality does not establish that broader property.
+
+The actual canonical evidence CLI accepts VC07 unlinked and conditional bundles, rejects missing completion, absent exact link and dollar-primary relabeling. The stronger DOLLAR-BAD-ORDER negative retains original S02 raw bytes, then forges/erases computed C primary evidence and claims genuine_unbudgeted. The independently authored raw assertion rejects its fabricated applicability/release. The static canonical checker intentionally cannot reconstruct those raw dollars; that is the disclosed D3 boundary.
